# Multi-Zones

Zones:

| App | Path | Port | Notes |
|-----|------|------|-------|
| `apps/home` | `/*` (router) | 3000 | `rewrites` to other zones; HTTPS in `dev` |
| `apps/passport` | `/passport` | 3100 | `assetPrefix: /passport-static`; routes under `app/passport` |
| `apps/storybook` | `/storybook` | 6006 | Next zone; `assetPrefix: /storybook-static`; UI in `public/storybook` |

## Rules

- URL paths must be unique across zones
- Next secondary zones: use `assetPrefix`, **not** `basePath` (follow with-zones)
- Cross-zone links: use `<a>`, never Next `<Link>`
- Next zones: set `serverActions.allowedOrigins` for the user-facing origin (`localhost:3000`)
- Local **Next** `dev` uses HTTPS (`next dev --experimental-https`); zone URLs are `https://localhost:<port>` — ADR [0012](../../docs/adr/0012-https-local-next-dev.md)
- Shared UI: `@repo/ui` (Tailwind + shadcn); import `@repo/ui/globals.css` in app layouts
- Storybook authoring HMR: `pnpm --filter @repo/storybook dev:stories` on `:6007` (HTTP; not a Next app)
- Do not add `app/storybook/page.tsx` (conflicts with `public/storybook`)
- Architecture changes to zones/routing/UI system require an ADR under `docs/adr/`
